  -- approach: a nonnegative band-limited kernel (Fejér, sinc²(πu/8)) that is ≥ c > 0 on [−2, 0] has bounded weighted sums Σ f(n) K₀(log(n/X))/n for X ≥ 1 (Fourier side, σ → 1+ by monotone convergence); the blocks N/4 < n ≤ N then carry at most (K/c)N, and summing the blocks gives S(N) = O(N).
